# Frontend Development Rules - shadcn/ui Only

## 🎯 **MANDATORY: shadcn/ui Components Only**

### **CRITICAL RULE:**
- **ALL frontend components MUST use shadcn/ui components exclusively**
- **NO custom HTML elements** (div, button, input, etc.) for UI components
- **NO other UI libraries** (Material-UI, Ant Design, etc.)
- **NO custom styled components** without shadcn base

### **Required Component Usage:**

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT - Use shadcn components
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from '@/components/ui/card'
import { Input } from '@/components/ui/input'
import { Label } from '@/components/ui/label'
import { Alert, AlertDescription } from '@/components/ui/alert'
import { Badge } from '@/components/ui/badge'

// ❌ FORBIDDEN - Direct HTML elements
<button onClick={handleClick}>Click me</button>
<input type="text" value={value} onChange={onChange} />
<div className="custom-styles">Content</div>
```

### **Available shadcn Components:**
- Button, Card, Input, Label, Alert, Badge
- Dialog, Select, Textarea, Checkbox, RadioGroup
- Switch, Slider, Progress, Skeleton, Avatar
- Separator, ScrollArea, Tabs, Accordion, Collapsible
- Popover, Tooltip, DropdownMenu, Command, Calendar
- Table, Sheet, Drawer, Sonner (Toast)

### **Styling Rules:**
- Use shadcn variants: `variant="outline"`, `size="sm"`
- Use shadcn spacing: `space-y-4`, `gap-2`, `p-4`
- Use shadcn colors: `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`
- NO custom CSS classes for UI styling
- NO inline styles for UI components

### **Component Structure Pattern:**
```typescript
export function MyComponent() {
  return (
    <Card>
      <CardHeader>
        <CardTitle>Title</CardTitle>
      </CardHeader>
      <CardContent>
        <div className="space-y-4">
          <div className="space-y-2">
            <Label htmlFor="input">Label</Label>
            <Input id="input" placeholder="Enter text" />
          </div>
          <Button type="submit">Submit</Button>
        </div>
      </CardContent>
    </Card>
  )
}
```

### **Adding New Components:**
If you need a component that doesn't exist, add it with:
```bash
npx shadcn@latest add [component-name]
```

### **Exception Cases:**
- ✅ Layout containers (`<div>`, `<main>`, `<section>`) for page structure
- ✅ Semantic HTML (`<h1>`, `<p>`, `<span>`) for content
- ❌ UI components that have shadcn equivalents

---

## 🚨 **ENFORCEMENT:**
- **ALWAYS** suggest shadcn components for any UI element
- **NEVER** suggest direct HTML elements for UI
- **REQUIRE** refactoring if non-shadcn UI elements are used
- **PRIORITIZE** shadcn design system consistency